* A part of the deviance portion of the saddle point approximation:
* the returned value is {@code x * log(x / mu) + mu - x}. When {@code x}
* is close to {@code mu} it is evaluated with a series expansion.

trigger.code:
@Test
public void testAllTrialsSucceedingAtHighRate() {
    BinomialDistribution dist = new BinomialDistribution(20, 0.95);
    Assert.assertEquals(20 * FastMath.pow(0.95, 19) * 0.05, dist.probability(19), 1e-12);
    Assert.assertEquals(FastMath.pow(0.95, 20), dist.probability(20), 1e-12);
}

